  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/753",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">스테라리움 어플</span> 수업을 준비하다가</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">갤럭시 폰</span>에 더 직관적으로 알 수 있는 방법이 있네요.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf4aa29d161c3db8f2467bb5e9f1d958883e831d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf4aa29d161c3db8f2467bb5e9f1d958883e831d\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1544\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;더보기&gt; 에서&#160; 클릭!</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44463564e64f14daafc684179323944cdab124ab\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44463564e64f14daafc684179323944cdab124ab\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1544\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>&lt;EXPERT RAW&gt; 설치!</b><br><b>고화질 촬영용 옵션인 것 같습니다. </b><br><b>용량이 좀 있어요.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/924e5fe29e5b57c1c6e266062e11acae75744531\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/924e5fe29e5b57c1c6e266062e11acae75744531\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1544\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>우상단, 별자리 이미지 클릭시&#160;</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52d08054e25f7bba814c6956941440dd10a4f540\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52d08054e25f7bba814c6956941440dd10a4f540\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1544\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>별자리 가이드가 뜹니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br><b>염려되는 부분은,</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">최신 기종만 가능한 것인지</span> 부분과</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">아이폰은 이런거 없는지</span> 부분입니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br>혹시 정보있으시면 알려주셔요.<br>굽신굽신 ^^<br>&#160;<br>성도보고 떠듬떠듬하던 때가 어제 같은데<br>정말 세상이 놀랍게 좋아졌네요. ㅠㅡㅠ<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>출처: 그.. 아이폰 한강에서 주워서 애플초대되서 간 유튜버 분이신데<br>별사진 찍는 팁 많이 알려주시더라구요.&#160;<br>못찾아서 찾게 되면 댓글 올리겠습니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>ㅋ 찾았습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">괴짜TV</span></b><br>&#160;<br>버려둔 폰에 찍힌 밤하늘<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/oZ5JCyun-MM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/oZ5JCyun-MM</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/oZ5JCyun-MM\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/LmUlD/hyT2ukOOb7/rfChDXdXlu6cHGZVPDhk10/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dgc1AY/hyT2D9SNG8/CQ1KJoafMKkIfGh6tJAew1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oZ5JCyun-MM\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>이건, 수심이 깊어질 때 압력변화인데<br>보일의 법칙에 딱이네요.<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Z_c0F7En28I\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Z_c0F7En28I</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Z_c0F7En28I\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cegZpX/hyT2y8zLYj/0jmDmDl04IqkXhfEK8iXs1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/beADzP/hyTY6FUgL7/S2IkQx5osEnp9zLAvCIgKk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z_c0F7En28I\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>이건 최근 상온 초전도체 관련&#160;<br>영상 너무 좋아요.<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7U03Yi9DQPE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7U03Yi9DQPE</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7U03Yi9DQPE\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpl3wk/hyT2wQtAgk/9DKsnOyC1ANIAkwxv45rD1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=194_190_268_271,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bMEkmr/hyT2AFkqFy/YQ5b4yW1xKcihNrPWfPkU1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=194_190_268_271\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7U03Yi9DQPE\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
